#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:327
msgid "color **ccellnoise** ( vector v )"
msgstr "color **ccellnoise** ( vector v )"

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:329
msgid ""
"``cellnoise`` generates a field of constant colored cubes based on the "
"integer location.  This is the same as the `PRMan cellnoise function "
"<https://renderman.pixar.com/resources/RenderMan_20/cellnoise.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"``cellnoise`` tworzy pole sześcianów o stałej barwie na podstawie położenia "
"liczb całkowitych.  Jest to to samo co `funkcja szumu komórkowego PRMan "
"<https://renderman.pixar.com/resources/RenderMan_20/cellnoise.html>`_."

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:333
msgid "``ccellnoise`` outputs color cellnoise."
msgstr "``ccellnoise`` daje barwny szum komórkowy."

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:335
msgid ""
"float **fbm** ( vector v, int octaves = 6, float lacunarity = 2, float "
"gain = 0.5 )"
msgstr ""
"float **fbm** ( vector v, int octaves = 6, float lacunarity = 2, float "
"gain = 0.5 )"

